/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Expressing\040Emotions\040with\040the\040Social\040Robot\040Probo)
/Author (Jelle\040Saldien\054\040Kristof\040Goris\054\040Bram\040Vanderborght\054\040Johan\040Vanderfaeillie\054\040Dirk\040Lefeber)
/Subject (Probo\040is\040a\040huggable\040animal\055like\040robot\054\040designed\040to\040act\040as\040a\040social\040interface\056\040It\040will\040be\040used\040as\040a\040platform\040to\040study\040human\040robot\040interaction\040\050HRI\051\040while\040employing\040human\055like\040social\040cues\040and\040communication\040modalities\056\040The\040robot\040has\040a\040fully\040actuated\040head\054\040with\04020\040degrees\040of\040freedom\054\040capable\040of\040showing\040facial\040expressions\040and\040making\040eye\055contact\056\040The\040basic\040facial\040expressions\040are\040represented\040as\040a\040vector\040in\040the\0402\055dimensional\040emotion\040space\040based\040on\040Russel\220s\040circomplex\040model\040of\040affect\040\050Posner\040et\040al\056\040in\040Dev\056\040Psychopathol\056\04017\05003\051\072715\205734\054\0402005\051\056\040The\040recognition\040of\040the\040underlying\040emotions\040based\040on\040the\040robot\220s\040facial\040expressions\040were\040tested\040in\040different\040user\040studies\040and\040compared\040with\040similar\040robotic\040projects\056\040This\040paper\040describes\040the\040concepts\040of\040the\040robot\040Probo\040and\040the\040ability\040to\040express\040emotional\040states\056)
/Keywords (11\040Aug\0402010\054\040International\040Journal\040of\040Social\040Robotics\054\040Social\040robot\054\040Facial\040expression\054\040Human\205robot\040interaction\054\040Vrije\040Universiteit\040Brussel)
>>
endobj
